# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [Unreleased]

### Added
- **2025-04-03** [[PR-4]](https://github.com/AGH-CEAI/scene_props/pull/4) - Added `pre-commit` to the codebase.
- Creation of insertion boxes for only one pegs.
- Phase rotation for uniform n-gon vertices.
- Peg in hole (PiH) generation scripts (prisms as pegs with dedicated insertion boxes).
- Created scripts for automatic generation of all PiH models.

### Fixed
- **2025-04-03** [[PR-5]](https://github.com/AGH-CEAI/scene_props/pull/5) - Fixed peg-in-hole assembly hole tolerances. Now, the tolerance distance is calculated from the peg's wall to the hole's wall instead of from the peg's vertex to the hole's vertex.

### Changed
- Holes: set tolerance options to 5mm or 10mm.
- Pegs: due to problems with collisions in simulation, changed cylinder into 12-gonal prism,
- Pegs: from 3,4,5-gonals prims to 4,6,8-gonals prims (easier to grasp with finger gripper).
